Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Find review (U15): the reader follows the address's verse
 as it changes

The header's search sends "John 3:16" to /study/bible/john/3#v16. On John 3 itself that changed only the hash, and the reader read the hash once, on load, so nothing opened. The reader now follows the hash through wouter's location events, and a new hash wins over an earlier pick. Back and Forward between verses follow it too.

